From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Mon Nov 19 16:29:30 2001
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian Ripley)
Date: Mon, 19 Nov 2001 16:29:30 +0000
Subject: Re: repeated measure ANOVA with NAs
In-Reply-To: <3BF92E30.14278429@pse.unige.ch>
References: <3BF92E30.14278429@pse.unige.ch>
