Michael,

This function returns the same thing as yours without explicit for loops:

"sqrWave"<-
function(rads, terms)
{
        terms <- seq(0, terms)
        rowSums(outer(rads, terms, function(x, y)
        sin((2 * y + 1) * pi * x)/(2 * y + 1)))
}

-Stephen Kaluzny

