From Paul.Bliese at NA.AMEDD.ARMY.MIL  Fri Nov 30 17:10:51 2001
From: Paul.Bliese at NA.AMEDD.ARMY.MIL (Bliese, Paul D MAJ WRAIR-Wash DC)
